      "body": "Setup for the merged Java PR links M01-M10 brief, no claims. M01 RoaringBitmap, M02 jackson-databind, M03 vavr, M04 commons-compress, M05 commons-rng, M06 agrona, M07 spatial4j and M09 libgdx are built at both pins with their jars, class digests and runtime classpaths under ~/.cache/in-the-loop/merged-pr-links-m01-m10; for each the landed test passes on the fix and fails on the parent (M04's needs four fix-only accessor lines removed to compile there; M07 has no landed test, and issue #210's reproduction throws on the parent and succeeds on the fix). Offline builds checked. Released versions the brief names are resolved with strict checksums and signatures checked. M02's four 3.2.0/2.22 snapshot inputs are no longer served and were rebuilt from their own upstream commits before the parent pin.\n\nM08 Checkstyle and M10 TinkerPop build by job: 20261125-202838-setup-build-checkstyle-at-both-14128-rev (queued in the previous commit) and 20261125-202839-setup-build-tinkerpop-gremlin-core-and-t.",
